Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The curated transition datasets in `datasets/` -- `transport_links.json`,
`spell_teleports.json`, and `item_teleports.json` -- are not original to this
project. They derive from the community-maintained "Gibson" transport data and
the `nav_data` export, and have since been reformatted, consolidated, and
extended for WorldWalker's schema.

Credit for the original survey work belongs to those upstream maintainers.

The MIT license in LICENSE is WorldWalker's grant over its own source code. It
is NOT a license over these data files, and is not a claim of authorship over
the upstream work they descend from. Their upstream terms could not be
established -- see the provenance section of datasets/README.md -- so treat them
as unknown rather than permissive, and do not assume MIT terms when reusing them
in another project.

If you are an upstream maintainer and want the attribution worded differently --
or the files removed -- please open an issue.

The datasets record factual game data (tile coordinates, interface and varbit
ids, tick costs). They contain no RuneScape game assets, no cache contents, and
no decryption keys.

